<title>UK: Goldman Sachs warrants on Deutsche Bank.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs warrants on Deutsche Bank.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier has issued five million American-style call warrants on Deutsche Bank, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co oHG said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    90.00 DEM		 PREMIUM	14.73 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.70 DEM		  GEARING	12.08 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 17.FEB.97-18.DEC.98   PAYDATE	14.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   DDF FFT STG	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  84.55 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
